 and Jocelyn Benson in Michigan. Trump voted early in Palm Beach and rallies in Port Huron, Michigan, on Sunday.","date":"2026-10-24"}],"media":[{"who":"Nate Silver","what":"His Silver Bulletin forecast gave Sherrod Brown a 73.9% chance to unseat Jon Husted.","when":"2026-10-06","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Brian Tyler Cohen","what":"Interviewed Ohio Senate candidate Sherrod Brown; the episode page listed it as 5 days old on Oct 22.","when":"2026-10-17","lean":"D"},{"who":"Jake Paul","what":"Spoke at Trump's Youngstown rally and urged Ohioans to vote Nov 3 so Republicans keep control, without naming candidates.","when":"2026-10-12","lean":"R"},{"who":"Harry Enten","what":"In a YouTube forecast video listed Ohio as a Democratic lead of 3 points.","when":"2026-08-17","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Harry Enten","what":"Named Ohio among six toss up Senate races and warned Democrats of a big siren because polls are within the margin of error.","when":"2026-10-16","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Ali Velshi","what":"Anchored The 11th Hour live from Columbus covering the Ohio Senate contest.","when":"2026-10-13","lean":"D"},{"who":"Karl Rove","what":"Said he is worried for Republicans in Ohio.","when":"2026-10-20","lean":"R"},{"who":"Karl Rove","what":"On the Journal Editorial Report called Sherrod Brown a terrific candidate and predicted a horserace with Jon Husted.","when":"2026-06-08","lean":"R"}],"donorSignal":{"z":0.406,"parts":{"instate":0.588,"breadth":-0.009,"small":0.639,"reach":0.406},"shift_logit":0.0,"applies":false},"research":{"summary":"Appointed Republican Sen. Jon Husted is defending the seat JD Vance vacated against former Democratic Sen. Sherrod Brown, in a race Axios calls a toss up that could decide Senate control. With more than 400 million dollars spent or reserved and no debates planned, the contest centers on costs, data centers and Husted's record, while Republicans press cultural attacks on Brown.","issues":[{"issue":"Cost of living","why":"Brown says lowering costs is his top priority and accuses Husted of voting to raise prices, while Husted pitches tax credits and job training so Ohioans earn more.","src":"https://www.daytondailynews.com/local/brown-husted-make-pitches-on-affordability-data-centers-and-more-in-u-s-senate-race/article_ee049cb6-dd24-5ebb-89be-7239303dcff5.html"},{"issue":"Data centers and power bills","why":"Brown calls Husted the face of data centers in Ohio, and Husted introduced a bill on data centers covering their power costs that Democrats blocked.","src":"https://www.axios.com/local/columbus/2026/10/21/jon-husted-sherrod-brown-ohio-senate-seat-election-2026"},{"issue":"Iran war and fuel prices","why":"Brown says ending the war would be his first priority, while Husted wants it to end on terms favorable to America.","src":"https://www.daytondailynews.com/local/brown-husted-make-pitches-on-affordability-data-centers-and-more-in-u-s-senate-race/article_ee049cb6-dd24-5ebb-89be-7239303dcff5.html"},{"issue":"FirstEnergy and special interests","why":"Brown ties Husted to FirstEnergy and drug companies, calling him special interest Jon.","src":"https://www.statenews.org/government-politics/2026-10-09/ohio-us-senate-race-tight-race-forces-gop-to-surge-in-resources"},{"issue":"Transgender policy","why":"Republican ads accuse Brown of supporting gender transition care for minors, an attack also used in his 2024 loss.","src":"https://www.daytondailynews.com/local/brown-husted-make-pitches-on-affordability-data-centers-and-more-in-u-s-senate-race/article_ee049cb6-dd24-5ebb-89be-7239303dcff5.html"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Obama rallies with Brown in Cleveland","date":"2026-10-24","what":"Former President Obama campaigned with Brown and Acton, joking that Husted and Ramaswamy act like they never heard of Trump. Brown named Musk, Thiel and Trump as billionaires backing Husted.","helps":"D","kind":"rally","src":"https://signalohio.org/barack-obama-ohio-democrats-campaign-against-trumpothers-in-cleveland-rally/"},{"title":"Husted distances himself from Ramaswamy ad","date":"2026-10-21","what":"Husted told the AP he would not have run the governor nominee's ad featuring Amy Acton's estranged mother, as Ohio Republicans worried about fallout with women voters.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://time.com/article/2026/10/21/ramaswamy-s-ad-of-acton-s-estranged-mom-jolts-ohio-races-across-the-ballot/"},{"title":"No debates planned","date":"2026-10-21","what":"Axios reports no debates are planned between Husted and Brown before Election Day.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.axios.com/local/columbus/2026/10/21/jon-husted-sherrod-brown-ohio-senate-seat-election-2026"},{"title":"Ad attacking Brown on gender care","date":"2026-10-15","what":"An attack ad circulating against Brown accuses him of supporting gender transition for youth. Brown's campaign says the focus distracts from economic issues.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.daytondailynews.com/local/brown-husted-make-pitches-on-affordability-data-centers-and-more-in-u-s-senate-race/article_ee049cb6-dd24-5ebb-89be-7239303dcff5.html"},{"title":"Brown's High Cost Husted Tour","date":"2026-10-15","what":"Brown has held High Cost Husted events tying Husted to rising prices, while Husted says Brown has few signature achievements after 32 years in Congress.","helps":"mixed","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.daytondailynews.com/local/brown-husted-make-pitches-on-affordability-data-centers-and-more-in-u-s-senate-race/article_ee049cb6-dd24-5ebb-89be-7239303dcff5.html"},{"title":"GOP surges resources into Ohio","date":"2026-10-09","what":"About 250 million dollars was spent on Ohio ads by the end of September with Republicans generally ahead, and AFP Action says it knocked more than 700,000 doors for Husted.","helps":"R","kind":"national","src":"https://www.statenews.org/government-politics/2026-10-09/ohio-us-senate-race-tight-race-forces-gop-to-surge-in-resources"},{"title":"Trump and Vance rally for Husted","date":"2026-10-09","what":"Trump and Vance made three combined rally visits to Ohio by mid October to boost Husted, who said he felt a shift in energy.","helps":"R","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.statenews.org/government-politics/2026-10-09/ohio-us-senate-race-tight-race-forces-gop-to-surge-in-resources"}],"events":[{"title":"Data center power costs","prompt":"Ohio families are seeing higher electric bills as data centers multiply, and your opponent says you are on the wrong side. You must lay out a data center position.","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.axios.com/local/columbus/2026/10/21/jon-husted-sherrod-brown-ohio-senate-seat-election-2026","opts":[{"label":"Make them pay full cost","say":"Require data centers to pay the full cost of their electricity so residents are not stuck with the bill.","pos":-0.6,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Voluntary cost sharing","say":"Ask states to consider having data centers cover power costs while keeping the investment coming.","pos":0.2,"trump":0.2,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Build more power","say":"Cut regulation on nuclear, gas and pipelines so supply grows and prices fall.","pos":0.8,"trump":0.6,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Ramaswamy ad fallout","prompt":"Your party's governor nominee is running an ad featuring his opponent's estranged mother and reporters want your reaction.","issue":"other","src":"https://time.com/article/2026/10/21/ramaswamy-s-ad-of-acton-s-estranged-mom-jolts-ohio-races-across-the-ballot/","opts":[{"label":"Condemn it loudly","say":"Call the ad despicable and say it shows who the other side really is.","pos":-0.5,"trump":-0.7,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Would not run it","say":"Say you would not have run that ad and pivot back to costs.","pos":0,"trump":-0.2,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Defend free speech","say":"Say voters can judge the ad and the media should focus on the other party.","pos":0.6,"trump":0.8,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Iran war and fuel prices","prompt":"D